Z||000000||Master_Sushi||06-27-2000||10:15 PM||||WEll I finally got some pictures of my new fiero taken. Its a 1988 coupe in almost perfect shape with 48000 miles. Its been taken care of all its life by an older lady. I have spent the last few days washing and waxing, cleaning up the engine, and installing a new valve gasget. I was thinking about puting on a stock spoiler and some nice 5 spoke rims but it is in just to beautiful a shape to do anything to it   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">. As you can see in the pics its next to my fathers 2000 firebird(I enjoy driving the fiero more then it hehe). Anyways thanks for reading my post and looking at my pics   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sushis.jpg"> <p>[This message has been edited by Master_Sushi (edited 06-27-2000).]||||reg||7
