Z||000010||Master_Sushi||06-28-2000||09:29 PM||||Thanks for all the complements! Its a pretty basic fiero. The only options it really has are AC and automatic trans. I have done allot of work on her recently though. Such as lots of washing  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">, new head gasget (the engine was pretty soaked with oil, not a good thing for a fiero  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> ) since I had the engine somewhat taken apart I cleaned it up nicely and painted the air filter holder. I also installed a new air filter. I have never seen a dirtier air filter. This thing was the orignal AcDelco(lol), it was completely black and non-translucent. After I replaced it the engine has ALLOT more power, before it had no power after about 3k rpm, and it is ideling lower. It does need the rotors turned soon. All in all the car was very well taken care of but not well maintaned. Such as  never being waxed (looked like it), and having an oily engine with an old black air filter. I  think have decided to keep the car stock  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">. She will be well taken car of all her life.<P>Oh and nice ride Homicidal  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> looks like mine, I would like to get a nice pair of tires like yours in the future, mine are orignal, hehe.||||reg||6
Z||000011||Master_Sushi||06-28-2000||09:31 PM||||Oh yeah just FYI, the fieros the white one. lol  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
