Z||000013||Master_Sushi||06-29-2000||11:07 PM||||The rims are shiny  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">, but they do have a few little spots where the clear coat chiped on them  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">. Its hardly noticeable up close though. I will get them fixed one day.||||reg||1
